    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where your deepest fears become reality and solve puzzles that challenge both courage and intellect in this thrilling VR experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR WAY </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way across precarious platforms suspended in darkness, where falling is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/bd1bb9a897e561fc1e0f4fc3316c4a71.poster.avif?t=1746034639\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/bd1bb9a897e561fc1e0f4fc3316c4a71.webm?t=1746034639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/bd1bb9a897e561fc1e0f4fc3316c4a71.mp4?t=1746034639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE DIFFERENT FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront the fear of heights as you navigate misleading paths and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/9ae9cf3000622ec78958d89f53174e91.poster.avif?t=1746034639\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/9ae9cf3000622ec78958d89f53174e91.webm?t=1746034639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/9ae9cf3000622ec78958d89f53174e91.mp4?t=1746034639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DON'T FALL DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful what step you take, it could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/95cc82e95f132a3214579d29e94c0c9a.poster.avif?t=1746034639\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/95cc82e95f132a3214579d29e94c0c9a.webm?t=1746034639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/95cc82e95f132a3214579d29e94c0c9a.mp4?t=1746034639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Kira and his faithful teddy bear as they find themselves high above an abyss in a dark and mysterious realm. Every step could be their last, and only by facing the vertigo-inducing heights can they hope to escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a minimalist puzzle world brought to life with stunning 3D visuals that amplify the sensation of towering heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique melodies and soundscapes that intensify the atmosphere and draw you deeper into Kira's journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you brave enough to face your fears and help Kira find his way out?</strong></h2>",
